# Student Management System - Test Plan

This document describes the testing plan for the backend and frontend of the Student Management System project. It includes test cases, expected results, screenshots, and notes about known issues.
## Scope
- Included: API routes (students, courses, grades, attendance, login), frontend login pages.
- Excluded: PUT/DELETE routes for students (still under development).
## Test Environment
- Backend: Flask app running at http://127.0.0.1:5000
- Frontend: Static files served at http://127.0.0.1:5500/fronend/
- Database: sms.db with sample data
- Tools: Browser, Postman, Python test script (backend/test_api.py)
## Test Cases

### TC-01: Get Students
- **Action:** GET /api/students
- **Expected:** JSON list of students
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Students GET](screenshots/students-get.png)

### TC-02: Get Courses
- **Action:** GET /api/courses
- **Expected:** JSON list of courses (empty if none exist)
- **Result:** ⚠️ Empty list
- **Screenshot:** ![Courses GET](screenshots/courses-get.png)

### TC-03: Add Course
- **Action:** POST /api/courses {name:"Intro to Python", description:"CS101", teacher_id:1}
- **Expected:** {"success":true,"message":"Course added successfully"}
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Course POST](screenshots/courses-post.png)

### TC-04: Get Grades
- **Action:** GET /api/grades
- **Expected:** JSON list of grades
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Grades GET](screenshots/grades-get.png)

### TC-05: Get Attendance
- **Action:** GET /api/attendance
- **Expected:** JSON list of attendance records
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Attendance GET](screenshots/attendance-get.png)

### TC-06: Admin Login
- **Action:** POST /api/auth/login with admin credentials
- **Expected:** {"success":true,"role":"admin","token":"mock-token"}
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Admin Login](screenshots/login-admin.png)

### TC-07: Teacher Login
- **Action:** POST /api/auth/login with teacher credentials
- **Expected:** {"success":true,"role":"teacher","token":"mock-token"}
- **Result:** ✅ Passed
- **Screenshot:** ![Teacher Login](screenshots/login-teacher.png)
## Known Issues
- PUT and DELETE routes for students not implemented.
- Frontend pages still use sample data instead of API calls.
- Login returns mock tokens (not real authentication).
## Conclusion
The backend API is functional for GET and POST routes. Login works for both admin and teacher roles. Future work will include PUT/DELETE routes and full frontend integration.
